04:45:33.368 --> 04:45:37.280
number of residents that are

04:45:37.320 --> 04:45:39.700
regularly at 100 Vic.

04:45:40.200 --> 04:45:44.660
And then I'm wondering if you can talk a little bit about what's

04:45:45.720 --> 04:45:49.332
on the Runway in terms of, of new housing and I

04:45:49.356 --> 04:45:53.236
think specifically of what is coming

04:45:53.308 --> 04:45:56.580
forward in terms of the YW, the old

04:45:56.620 --> 04:45:59.840
YW building, on Frederick street,

04:46:01.260 --> 04:46:05.092
which is slated to happen, you know, in the next six

04:46:05.116 --> 04:46:08.880
to nine months. What's slated to happen at 97

04:46:10.140 --> 04:46:13.600
Victoria as part of the

04:46:14.350 --> 04:46:18.342
the soup kitchen, and then both of those which are

04:46:18.366 --> 04:46:22.102
this year, and then what's slated to

04:46:22.206 --> 04:46:25.702
come on stream next year with the

04:46:25.726 --> 04:46:29.222
House of Friendship building? Because I

04:46:29.246 --> 04:46:33.530
think those are important factors in this whole discussion.

04:46:37.390 --> 04:46:40.454
Thank you. And through you Chair, Councillor Vrbanovic, Yes.

04:46:40.502 --> 04:46:43.752
So at the the peak, if my

04:46:43.776 --> 04:46:47.256
memory serves, there were Approximately upwards

04:46:47.288 --> 04:46:51.300
of 90 people at 100 Victoria At the peak, in the early

04:46:51.760 --> 04:46:55.320
days or the summer of 2022, prior to

04:46:55.360 --> 04:46:58.140
last week, on a regular basis,

04:46:59.040 --> 04:47:02.392
there were approximately 36 individuals. We do

04:47:02.416 --> 04:47:06.152
know because of the connections we've had with outreach staff,

04:47:06.336 --> 04:47:10.390
some of those folks are there on a daily basis. Some of those 36,

04:47:11.090 --> 04:47:15.162
you know, have some belongings there and

04:47:15.186 --> 04:47:18.666
come and go on a regular basis in and out. I can

04:47:18.738 --> 04:47:21.914
address the second part of your question. I might not have all of

04:47:21.922 --> 04:47:25.386
the numbers off the top of my head, Councillor, but yeah,

04:47:25.418 --> 04:47:29.306
So later this summer, the women's

04:47:29.338 --> 04:47:33.402
shelter at 84 Frederick will increase by approximately

04:47:33.466 --> 04:47:37.666
20 beds. The Working Center's

04:47:37.858 --> 04:47:41.170
