04:53:00.608 --> 04:53:03.928
agree with Councillor Vrbanovic and my other

04:53:03.984 --> 04:53:07.560
fellow councillors about the commentary about the

04:53:07.600 --> 04:53:11.608
safety of 100 Vic

04:53:11.704 --> 04:53:15.656
