04:53:38.986 --> 04:53:42.610
been affected. I think the bylaw is in every possible

04:53:42.730 --> 04:53:46.178
way trying to move forward to help people

04:53:46.314 --> 04:53:50.178
and to move ahead in terms of community safety

04:53:50.274 --> 04:53:53.474
on so many levels. The delegations tonight,

04:53:53.522 --> 04:53:57.618
