04:54:49.860 --> 04:54:53.604
And I think now we have to focus on that. Thank you, Madam Chair.

04:54:53.692 --> 04:54:55.560
Thank you. Councillor Salonen.

04:54:56.700 --> 04:54:59.764
Thank you through you, Chair. And thank you, Councillor Craig,

