05:03:14.976 --> 05:03:18.536
nine CTS allowed by the court to stay open.

05:03:18.688 --> 05:03:22.264
By not funding them, the province has forced the Kitchener CTS

05:03:22.392 --> 05:03:25.090
and others to close closed despite the injunction.

05:03:25.670 --> 05:03:29.182
Staff and some counselors have expressed fear that the funds for

05:03:29.206 --> 05:03:32.478
